English summary

This repository contains an application and its documentation; it does
not contain source code. Two separate terms therefore apply:

1. The application (binaries in Releases) — free to use for any purpose,
   personal or commercial. Redistribution of the unmodified package is
   permitted; please link back to this repository. No source is provided
   and no right to reverse engineer or redistribute modified versions is
   granted. Provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind.

2. Documentation and screenshots (README.md and docs/) — CC BY 4.0.
